OL,3,GNEWSAVillagers may be asked to help in
OL,4,AHGV crackdown
OL,5,
OL,6,FResidents across Wiltshire could soon
OL,7,Fbe enlisted to help tackle heavy goods
OL,8,Fvehicles (HGVs) ignoring 7.5-tonne
OL,9,Fweight restrictions by sending in video
OL,10,Fevidence.
OL,12,FMembers of the Wiltshire Police and
OL,13,FCrime Panel are creating the new
OL,14,Fcommunity-led approach with Wiltshire
OL,15,FCouncil, and the Driver and Vehicle
OL,16,FStandards Agency (DVSA), with support
OL,17,Ffrom Wiltshire Police and Crime
OL,18,FCommissioner Philip Wilkinson.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
